From d788066680968602a4f4e906dc2fabf9a8f35f4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:44:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rpc: expose one chain configuration and mining capability
 snapshot

Add getchainconfig as authoritative versioned discovery for a connection-scoped ChainAdaptor: explicit network/genesis identity, active currency, implemented address codecs, transaction/message capabilities and compiled proof-of-work description. Share currency and mining builders with existing RPCs; no ticker guesses, executable descriptors or authorization changes.

Describe SHA256d headers, numeric target versus raw digest byte order and nonce-only full-block submission. Functional checks compare independent genesis vectors, active RPC denomination, actual address option changes, generated templates and consensus-validated block submission.

